	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Recom REC20K-Z dual-output DIP 1in x 1in. Recommended hole 1.4 (+0.15/0). Pad XY from DS Rev.3-2025 p.9 and identical to REC10K-AW (only the hole diameter differs: REC10K 1.0 / REC20K 1.4), so this one footprint takes either module -- a REC10K (pin dia 0.6) still fits a 1.4 hole. Pad XY from DS Rev.3-2025 p.9 Recommended Footprint Details (top view); pin1 at (0,0), rotated so the input row is y=0. Dual: 1=+Vin 2=-Vin 3=CTRL 4=-Vout 5=COM 6=+Vout. NOTE: the hole pattern is identical to DKMW20F-15_1in_THT and the function at each hole matches; only the manufacturer pin numbering differs (industry-standard 1in 6-pin layout), so the two modules are physically interchangeable.")
